 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 532684,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the surface area and volume of the cylinder with a radius of  7cm and a height of 5 cm.<br>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/368e36efa9f64f16.png\" alt=\"A cylinder with its radius and height marked 7 centimeters and 5 centimeters.\">\n</figure>\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The surface area of a right cylinder with radius <i>r</i> and height <i>h</i> is <span data-math=\"SA = 2\\pi {r^2} + 2\\pi rh\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"SA = 2\\pi {r^2} + 2\\pi rh = 2\\pi {\\left( {7{\\text{ cm}}} \\right)^2} + 2\\pi \\left( {7{\\text{ cm}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\text{5 cm}}} \\right) \\approx 527.78{\\text{ c}}{{\\text{m}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>The surface area is 527.78 square centimeters.</p>\n<p>The volume of a right cylinder with radius <i>r</i> and height <i>h</i> is <span data-math=\"V = \\pi {r^2}h\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"V = \\pi {r^2}h = \\pi {\\left( {7{\\text{ cm}}} \\right)^2}\\left( {{\\text{5 cm}}} \\right) \\approx 769.69{\\text{ c}}{{\\text{m}}^3}\"></span></p>\n<p>The volume is 769.69 cubic centimeters.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}\n  {SA}&amp;{ = }&amp;{527.78\\text{ cm}{^2}}\\\\ \n  {V}&amp;{ = }&amp;{769.69\\text{ cm}{^3}}\\\\ \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{rcl}\n  {SA}&amp;{ = }&amp;{527.78\\text{ cm}{^2}}\\\\ \n  {V}&amp;{ = }&amp;{769.69\\text{ cm}{^3}}\\\\ \\end{array}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
